From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance Fredrickson <lancethepants@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:36:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Listen on a unix socket with --listen unix:PATH

Lets the dashboard sit behind a reverse proxy (e.g. a router's own web
server) without opening a TCP port. A stale socket left by an unclean
exit is removed before binding.
